      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "備份所有的資料——滋——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "已經在做了，只需要最後一點時間！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "還有一件更重要的事情，關閉PRTS後必須下載它的核心資料——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "凱爾希已經提前在其中布置了後門。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那會是我們徹底斷絕本艦威脅的關鍵。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Mechanist已經收到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mantra",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我們正在Abyss中行動。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "拜託你們了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "博士，凱爾希受傷了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "可露希爾",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "怎麼沒有聽到她的動靜？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "她在全力幫助大家拖延時間。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我和阿米婭也會撐到最後一刻。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "羅德島……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "拜託你們了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "<p=1>Abyss內</><p=2>同一時間</>"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "已經恢復了和博士的聯繫。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我們按照原定計劃繼續行動。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "沒有感知到更多的敵人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我也沒有捕捉到PRTS核心產生任何新的數據傳輸。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "太安靜了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "Raidian，麻煩分享核心的位置。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "已同步。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "繼續向核心方位推進，嘗試解除核心的運作。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我走前面！PRTS一定會安排新一波次的敵人攔截我們。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "解析核心的工作交給我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "“極光”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "微光指引前路——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mechanist",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "怎麼了，Logos？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那並非我的光……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "黑暗中，高懸的菱形光環微微晃動著。\n如同一顆冰冷的眼睛，俯瞰著在場的所有人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "戒備……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……是凱爾希醫生提到的“普瑞賽斯”嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "恐怕不是。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我偵測到突然出現了大量雜亂但熟悉的訊號。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那些訊號來自羅德島本身。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Misery",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "這是……什麼東西？"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "龐大的機械構造物在無盡的白噪音中緩緩浮現在了所有人的面前——\n構成其主體的部件，在場之人都很熟悉。\n可露希爾曾許多次向大家展示這些她對羅德島不同模組改造時所用的部件，甚至一些特殊部件就出自精英幹員之手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Touch",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "PRTS重組了羅德島的設備作為武器。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Touch",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "但……這些部件是從哪冒出來的？Abyss裡明明沒有……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "源石。"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "源石的晶簇不規則地遍布在這尊造型獨特的機械上。\n它們不再僅僅吞噬，而是開始了創造。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Misery",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "等等，源石能做到再現羅德島的東西？"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "Logos想起了內化宇宙中那座高塔，也想起了殿下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "沒這麼簡單。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Logos",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "PRTS並沒有解碼源石數據的能力，其中必然有他人介入。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿斯卡綸",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "普瑞賽斯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Raidian",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "它的數據正透過我無法理解的方式和PRTS的核心相連，這個東西和之前那些源石結晶體不一樣！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "煌",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "無論如何，看起來怎麼都得打一架了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Stormeye",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "的確沒有其他辦法了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Stormeye",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "各位？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "迷迭香",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "可以動手。"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "此時，菱形的眼睛光芒更甚。\n由PRTS控制形成的擬態機械開始蓄積能量……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
